+
+    The API server has no approval button to click (OWUI / meowchat never render one),
+    so the ``/v1/runs/{id}/approval`` bridge is dead: every ESCALATE/DENY blocks the
+    agent thread for the whole ``approvals.timeout`` (300s) and then fails closed
+    anyway. Making the reviewer's verdict final removes that dead wait — same outcome
+    (block), minus the 5-minute stall. The reviewer is the stand-in for a permanent
+    YOLO, so its call should be the last word on these surfaces."""
+    try:
